# A Token of Troth (WotG 53), the whole run, nothing equipped, the Wedding Invitation held: the Bulwark Gate at Status 0
# plays 115 [98, 5, 1756, 0, 0, 1]; its finish sets Status 1. Then 116 [98, 5, 1756, 0, 0, 0, 1]; its finish completes
# the mission (Lest We Forget current), takes the Wedding Invitation and writes Lest We Forget's Status 1.
lists SauromugueChampaignS/Bulwark_Gate/onTrigger SauromugueChampaignS/onEventFinish/115 SauromugueChampaignS/onEventFinish/116
char zone=SauromugueChampaignS pos=-445.674,-1.831,342.417 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg ATokenOfTroth current
keyitem WeddingInvitation
login
trigger Bulwark_Gate                       # 115
finish                                     # Status 1
trigger Bulwark_Gate                       # 116
finish                                     # completed, the invitation taken, Lest We Forget Status 1
